# Generated by the Hologram compiler on every `HOLOGRAM_START=1 mix compile`.
# NOT committed in this public repo: the .js.map files embed the build
# machine's absolute checkout path in sourcesContent. The Docker build
# regenerates them in-image (mix compile runs after COPY priv), so nothing
# depends on tracked bundles. (Private-repo siblings in the fleet do commit
# them; see web/COPY.md.)
/priv/static/hologram/
